                        ],
                        "form": "se fac-similer"
                    },
                    {
                        "form_id": "ce6ecb45-2b02-4d0d-90bc-d0017893087a",
                        "entry_id": "ca3566b5-04d0-3552-92ca-726d10549eed",
                        "tags": [],
                        "form": "facsimiler"
                    }
                ],
                "senses": [
                    {
                        "sense_id": "e1934fb8-cd30-3429-a9b9-8a225c3c60a1",
                        "entry_id": "ca3566b5-04d0-3552-92ca-726d10549eed",
                        "glosses": [
                            "Reproduire à l'identique."
                        ],
                        "tags": [],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "1999f533-82be-43a1-ae90-f84b7f845786",
                                "sense_id": "e1934fb8-cd30-3429-a9b9-8a225c3c60a1",
                                "text": "Mais la salle étoit vide. On n’y remarquoit plus que l’infatigable M. Thour, fac-similant avec une patiente exactitude, sur des cartes soigneusement préparées, les titres des ouvrages qui avoient échappé la veille à son investigation quotidienne."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "c74acba7-e05a-49ba-be50-0e705a05049b",
                                "sense_id": "e1934fb8-cd30-3429-a9b9-8a225c3c60a1",
                                "text": "Les clichés héliographiques de M. Amand Durand, dont nous allons reparler à l'instant, sont excellents lorsqu'ils fac-similent des bois anciens, des dessins à la plume bien accusés, bien francs; c'est ainsi que M. J. B. Delestre a pu faire revivre les admirables croquis de Gros, son maître vénéré."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "961ea276-d6f4-4161-9aed-5f490f9415bf",
                                "sense_id": "e1934fb8-cd30-3429-a9b9-8a225c3c60a1",
                                "text": "Sa famille a conservé des croquis de Rousseau tout enfant qui dénotent également la certitude de sa vue et la précision de son travail. Il fac-similait à la plume les traits de gravure avec une étonnante exactitude […]."
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "sense_id": "fa878ec3-dc29-3bca-825b-7bee6207c59f",
                        "entry_id": "ca3566b5-04d0-3552-92ca-726d10549eed",
                        "glosses": [
                            "Se reproduire soi-même."
                        ],
                        "tags": [
                            "pronominal"
                        ],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "af288cdc-4146-458a-9c37-e02b2929ea31",
                                "sense_id": "fa878ec3-dc29-3bca-825b-7bee6207c59f",
                                "text": "À ceux [graveurs] qui sont obligés d’interpréter une image dont l’auteur n'est plus là pour se fac-similer lui-même…"
                            }
                        ]
                    }
                ],
                "translations": [
                    {
                        "translation_id": "20892ce3-ce25-40aa-8197-6241a54a155a",
                        "source_entry_id": "ca3566b5-04d0-3552-92ca-726d10549eed",
                        "source_sense_id": "e1934fb8-cd30-3429-a9b9-8a225c3c60a1",
                        "target_lang_word": "facsimile",
                        "target_lang_code": "en",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "facsimile",
                                "target_lang_code": "en",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "3d088309-61ee-35c2-ae87-791cca5b3ece",
                                        "entry_id": "91ad8348-db54-39fc-af18-693551f28107",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "A copy or reproduction."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "countable"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "04062f0b-1adb-433b-a708-8e19ffe94d85",
                                                "sense_id": "3d088309-61ee-35c2-ae87-791cca5b3ece",
                                                "text": "To paraphrase the critic of the Times, if one may make the facsimile of a human being out of bronze, why not the facsimile of a Brillo carton out of plywood?"
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "ae3c2273-e1dd-3e5e-bfd5-95f67ff975ce",
                                        "entry_id": "91ad8348-db54-39fc-af18-693551f28107",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Reproduction in the exact form as the original."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "uncountable"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "4f0a5b87-3234-4fd4-81ea-5e3267a65bac",
                                                "sense_id": "ae3c2273-e1dd-3e5e-bfd5-95f67ff975ce",
                                                "text": "Indeed his rendering is so excellent an example of mediæval learning and latinity that, even at the risk of sating the learned reader with too many antiquities, I have made up my mind to give it in fac-simile, together with an expanded version for the benefit of those who find the contractions troublesome."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "97626b8a-6881-3177-95c0-059b96b77ecb",
                                        "entry_id": "91ad8348-db54-39fc-af18-693551f28107",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "A fax, a machine for making and sending copies of printed material and images via radio or telephone network."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "countable",
                                            "uncountable"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": []
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "f03e30d9-e4c0-3a14-a433-cf081057eb4b",
                                        "entry_id": "91ad8348-db54-39fc-af18-693551f28107",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "The image sent by the machine itself."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "countable",
                                            "uncountable"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": []
                                    }
                                ]
                            },
